h1 Manifest @17,49,694,25
text One tree that the model writes, the screen renders and the model reads back. @17,86,694,21
text MX is a text format for anything on a screen. An agent writes it, patches it and observes it in the same syntax, with the engine's own layout boxes and diagnostics. One vocabulary of roles with a default look (button "Export CSV" disabled, metric Revenue $308k +14%), and any node may take a position, a size and paint children, so the same tree draws a funnel, a floor plan or a gauge down to the pixel while every painted thing keeps a label and a role. One engine, in Rust, lays out, paints, takes input and answers perception with no browser: a native window, headless, or WebAssembly in the browser. An importer turns rendered HTML into MX. @17,119,694,142
text Site and playground: @17,273,694,20
link https://brunopgalvao.github.io/manifest/ https://brunopgalvao.github.io/manifest/ @17,305,694,20
